    back: 'Data compression. While data compression can sometimes be a side effect or a separate process applied to data, it is not a primary security goal of cryptography. Cryptography focuses on confidentiality, integrity, authenticity, and non-repudiation.',
    category: 'Cybersecurity',
    pathwayId: 'cybersecurity',
    difficulty: 'beginner',
    tags: ['cybersecurity', 'primary', 'goal'],
