    front: 'What is the core principle behind Gary Vaynerchuk\'s content repurposing pyramid?',
    back: 'Create one piece of cornerstone content and extract multiple smaller pieces for different platforms. The pyramid approach maximizes efficiency by creating one high-quality long-form piece, then extracting and adapting key elements into platform-specific shorter content.',
    category: 'Content Creation',
    pathwayId: 'content-creation',
    difficulty: 'beginner',
    tags: ['content-creation', 'core', 'principle'],
