    front: 'Why is skill decomposition a crucial step in deliberate practice?',
    back: 'All of the above.. Skill decomposition serves multiple critical purposes: it breaks down complexity, enables the creation of specific goals, and helps pinpoint areas of weakness for focused, deliberate practice. All these aspects contribute to more effective learning.',
