    front: 'According to Sylvia Ann Hewlett\'s framework, which of the following is NOT one of the three pillars of Executive Presence?',
    back: 'Charisma. Sylvia Ann Hewlett identifies Gravitas, Communication, and Appearance as the three pillars of Executive Presence. While charisma can be a component of a leader\'s appeal, it is not listed as a distinct pillar in her specific framework for executive presence.',
