    front: 'What is the primary benefit of Causal Chain Mapping in Root Cause Analysis?',
    back: 'It provides a visual representation of the sequence of events and contributing factors leading to a problem.. Causal Chain Mapping excels at visually representing the chronological and logical sequence of events and the various contributing factors that ultimately lead to a problem. This helps in understanding complex interdependencies and identifying multiple points for intervention.',
