    front: 'Which of the following is NOT a core principle or technique associated with Edward de Bono\'s Lateral Thinking?',
    back: 'Vertical progression towards a single best solution.. Lateral Thinking focuses on generating new ideas by moving "sideways" and disrupting patterns, not on a vertical, sequential progression towards a single best solution, which is characteristic of vertical thinking.',
