    front: 'According to GTD, what is the primary purpose of the "Capture" phase?',
    back: 'To get everything that has your attention out of your head and into a trusted collection tool.. The Capture phase is solely about externalizing all "open loops" from your mind into an inbox. This clears mental space, allowing you to process and organize them later without the burden of remembering everything.',
